From: ProjectM TV contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Retain evaluator per-thread random state and lone-dot compatibility

Apply the focused remaining evaluator changes to upstream evaluator 22fb0cfd8f2dfbcd2b68f2443e7f44e19b32c09a: historical 0004 per-thread rand state and 0034 lone-dot parsing. Historical 0020 evaluator 1.0.7 fixes are already upstream. Preserve the focused pre-generated scanner delta without regenerating unrelated parser code. Original attribution and rationale: ProjectM-TV docs/UPSTREAM_PATCH_VALUE.md.

---
diff --git a/tests/libprojectM/EvaluatorLoneDotTest.cpp b/tests/libprojectM/EvaluatorLoneDotTest.cpp
